{"strongs": "H4604", "word": "מַ֫עַל", "translit": "ma.al", "root": "מעל", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "unfaithful, treacherous act", "definition": "I. מַ֫עַל noun masculine Ezra 9:2 unfaithful, treacherous act (Late Hebrew מְעִילָה ); — ׳ מ Lev 5:15 + 16 t.; מָ֑עַל Num 5:12 + 2 t.; suffix מַעֲלוֺ Ezek 17:20 + 4 t.; מַעֲלָם Ezek 39:26 + 3 t.; — 1. ag. man: נשׁאר מעל Job 21:34 faithlessness remains (compare Num 5:12 ; Num 5:27 ; Prov 16:10 under מָעַל ). 2. elsewhere ag. God, with בְּ , Josh 22:22 ( P ); without בְּ , 1Chr 9:1 ; 2Chr 29:19 ; 2Chr 33:19 ; Ezra 9:2 ; Ezra 9:4 ; Ezra 10:6 . — מַעַל elsewhere only with מָעַל q. v. ( 1 ; all cited ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4768')\">BDB4768</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4604')\">H4604</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4767')\">BDB4767</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4769')\">BDB4769</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>מַ֫עַל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ezra 9:2\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(15,9,2)\">Ezra 9:2</ref></sup> <highlightword>unfaithful, treacherous act</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <bdbheb>מְעִילָה</bdbheb>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,15)\">Lev 5:15</ref> + 16 t.; <bdbheb>מָ֑עַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 5:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,12)\">Num 5:12</ref> + 2 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מַעֲלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,20)\">Ezek 17:20</ref> + 4 t.; <bdbheb>מַעֲלָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 39:26\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(26,39,26)\">Ezek 39:26</ref> + 3 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> ag. man: <bdbheb>נשׁאר מעל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 21:34\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"2